$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Air";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Cold and Clammy" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Sunny, Clear but cold as hell" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Once again, two tribes kick each others asses to get the flag. All I can say is, ride the rollercoster of love baby!!!!!" @
         "\n\n<f1>Mission designed by:<f0> EEPROM of Mappers Extreme.";

